 "lq": [
  {
   "_id": 25392,
   "ANSWER": "<p>(I)</p>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"231\" data-start=\"202\">Step-by-step Conversion</h3>\n\n<ol data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"233\">\n\t<li data-end=\"291\" data-start=\"233\">\n\t<p data-end=\"291\" data-start=\"236\"><strong data-end=\"248\" data-start=\"236\">Sign bit</strong><br data-end=\"251\" data-start=\"248\" />\n\t12.375 is positive &rArr; <strong data-end=\"37\" data-start=\"21\">sign bit = 0</strong>.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"293\">\n\t<p data-end=\"335\" data-start=\"296\"><strong data-end=\"33\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Convert to binary &amp; normalize</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"339\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"380\" data-start=\"339\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"380\" data-start=\"341\">Integer part: 12 &rArr; <code data-end=\"26\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"19\">1100\u2082</code></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"545\" data-start=\"384\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"425\" data-start=\"386\">Fractional part: 0.375 &rArr;</p>\n\n\t\t<pre data-end=\"545\" data-start=\"431\">\n<code>0.375 &times; 2 = 0.75 &rarr; 0 0.75 &times; 2 = 1.5 &rarr; 1 0.5 &times; 2 = 1.0 &rarr; 1 &rArr; 0.011\u2082 </code></pre>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"590\" data-start=\"549\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"590\" data-start=\"551\">Combined: <code data-end=\"21\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"10\">1100.011\u2082</code></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"594\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"596\">Normalize: move binary point so form is <code data-end=\"58\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"40\">1.xxxxx\u2082 &times; 2^exp</code><br data-end=\"636\" data-start=\"633\" />\n\t\t&rArr; <code data-end=\"18\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"2\">1.100011\u2082 &times; 2&sup3;</code></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"680\">\n\t<p data-end=\"722\" data-start=\"683\"><strong data-end=\"29\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Exponent (8 bits, biased)</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"726\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"726\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"728\">Actual exponent = 3</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"771\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"773\">Bias = 127 &rArr; stored exponent = 3 + 127 = <strong data-end=\"48\" data-start=\"41\">130</strong> &rArr; in binary: <code data-end=\"73\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"62\">10000010\u2082</code></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"950\" data-start=\"814\">\n\t<p data-end=\"858\" data-start=\"817\"><strong data-end=\"28\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Mantissa (fraction bits)</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"950\" data-start=\"862\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"905\" data-start=\"862\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"905\" data-start=\"864\">From normalized form: <code data-end=\"33\" data-start=\"22\">1.100011\u2082</code>, drop the leading 1 &rArr; <code data-end=\"65\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"56\">.100011</code></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"950\" data-start=\"909\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"950\" data-start=\"911\">Pad to 23 bits: <code data-end=\"41\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"16\">10001100000000000000000</code></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"952\">\n\t<p data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"955\"><strong data-end=\"33\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Assemble final 32-bit pattern</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1000\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"1090\" data-start=\"1000\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"1090\" data-start=\"1002\">Sign | Exponent | Mantissa<br data-end=\"1044\" data-start=\"1041\" />\n\t\t0 | <code data-end=\"15\" data-start=\"5\">10000010</code> | <code data-end=\"53\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"28\">10001100000000000000000</code></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"1137\" data-start=\"1094\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"1137\" data-start=\"1096\">Full binary: <code data-end=\"49\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"13\">0 10000010 10001100000000000000000</code></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1141\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1143\">Hexadecimal: <strong data-end=\"1172\" data-start=\"1156\"><code data-end=\"1170\" data-start=\"1158\">0x41460000</code></strong></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1399\" data-start=\"1240\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1317\" data-start=\"1284\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1317\" data-start=\"1286\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>(II)</p>\n\n<ol data-end=\"2294\" data-start=\"1961\">\n\t<li data-end=\"2026\" data-start=\"1961\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2026\" data-start=\"1964\"><strong data-end=\"1986\" data-start=\"1964\">Convert to Binary:</strong> 0.75 = 0.11 in binary.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2084\" data-start=\"2027\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2084\" data-start=\"2030\"><strong data-end=\"2044\" data-start=\"2030\">Normalize:</strong> 1.1 &times; 2^-1.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2141\" data-start=\"2085\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2141\" data-start=\"2088\"><strong data-end=\"2101\" data-start=\"2088\">Sign Bit:</strong> 0 (positive number).</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2198\" data-start=\"2142\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2198\" data-start=\"2145\"><strong data-end=\"2158\" data-start=\"2145\">Exponent:</strong> -1 + 127 (bias) = 126 &rarr; 01111110 in binary.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2294\" data-start=\"2199\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2294\" data-start=\"2202\"><strong data-end=\"2215\" data-start=\"2202\">Fraction:</strong> The binary digits after the point: 100000... (padded to 23 bits).</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p data-end=\"2378\" data-start=\"2296\">Final 32-bit representation:</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2462\" data-start=\"2380\"><code data-end=\"36\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">0 01111110 10000000000000000000000</code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2546\" data-start=\"2464\">In hexadecimal: <code data-end=\"26\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"16\">3F400000</code></p>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSS201T",
   "LEVEL": 5,
